Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:01.86,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Huh?{EP58}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:03.16,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We're missing one-dechu!{EP58}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.58,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!{EP58}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.87,0:00:05.75,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,This is bad!{EP58}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:07.04,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaaruru's not on board!{EP58}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:09.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!  Gaalulu's not?!{EP58}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.75,0:00:10.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:11.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,The helicopter's about to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.83,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We need to find her-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:17.40,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,You go ahead, Unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:21.13,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu will stay here and find Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.41,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:26.38,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Our flight bound for PriPari is now departing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.94,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Got it-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:32.57,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Falulu, girls, I'm counting on you-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:38.23,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Where could Gaalulu be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:41.28,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,First off, why would Gaalulu have run off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:46.54,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu probably didn't want to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:48.50,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,She won't have fun even if she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:50.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:57.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Unicorn mentioned that all of the dejected feelings of girls who failed to be idols are gathered inside her...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:00:58.88,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:04.48,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,That's why Gaalulu's different than the others and hates music and dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.02,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.27,0:01:10.69,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,What should Falulu do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.69,0:01:11.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's look for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.95,0:01:12.52,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.52,0:01:13.73,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Found her-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:14.44,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.12,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,She's over there-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:17.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.15,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:23.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,He's right! It's Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:56.29,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's Sunny Once In A While.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.53,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I thought she was around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:05.93,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.37,0:03:10.60,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:13.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu, everyone already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You need to head back, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:15.60,Default-Alt,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ouchies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:20.90,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,This calls for the fast-footed Usagi-usa!{lit- leave it to the.... - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:23.24,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.24,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.10,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:24.44,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:24.98,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:25.34,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:25.74,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:26.71,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:28.95,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:30.70,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:34.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you all okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:35.69,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:38.42,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu is supposed to be Gaalulu's guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:40.45,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Is this Falulu's fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:41.73,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.65,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:47.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:53.83,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,You're doing the best you can in raising so many Mini Falulus-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.90,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,But whenever Falulu calls Gaalulu to come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:04:00.86,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,she never comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:02.63,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,And she's always by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:05.82,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,On top of that, if you try to make friends with her or greet her,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:08.26,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,she'll bite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:11.59,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,She hates both singing and dance lessons,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:14.59,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,and she won't watch any of Falulu's concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:17.26,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,And for some reason when Falulu tries to talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:20.12,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,all she ever says is Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:25.74,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,And to top it off, Falulu does her best\N to raise all the Mini Falulus,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:28.29,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,but she still has a long way to go with Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:31.18,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,What should Falulu do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:32.87,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,No! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:35.93,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,You're just completely exhausted from raising all those Mini Falulus-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:40.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Anyway, you just sit back and take a breather, Falulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:43.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll make sure to find Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.71,0:04:45.61,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.71,0:04:45.61,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,Leave it to us-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:53.83,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I've heard all thee has spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:58.21,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,After all, all children are demon spawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:05:00.93,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Whether to neglect that demon or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:02.54,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,it is up to thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:06.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Which means all of it is thy responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:10.01,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,How will thee take responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:14.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma's trying to say if you have troubles, why not consult someone-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:15.70,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:19.76,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Childcare consultation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:23.44,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.04,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We've finally got you cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.97,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.40,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, this is the end of the road, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:33.98,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We just want to talk a little bit, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:35.75,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If there's anything troubling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:38.66,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,we'd like you to tell us without biting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:40.12,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:43.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalu Gaalu Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:45.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalu Gaalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:47.88,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu gaalu gaalu gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:50.15,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,She's like a wild dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.15,0:05:52.09,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,If it's a dog, you can leave it to me-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.88,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I used to raise a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.05,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,When they had a bad temper,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:06:00.60,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'd give them a bone and they'd wag their tail and be happy-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:00.60,Default-Alt,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:01.66,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.31,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,My idol tush!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:08.39,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,When I'm upset, I eat sea snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:11.69,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,The sensation of biting into it when it's crispy is to die for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:14.41,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,So here's some sea snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.03,Default-Alt,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:17.77,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ah! Sea snail-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.16,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko understands-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:22.13,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You're going to go after Toriko next-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:23.69,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,But Toriko is a terrible substitute-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.61,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Even if it's a wing or done teriyaki style,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:29.09,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,you'll just complain that it's not as good as the Nagoya Cochin-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:31.44,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,So there's really no reward to eating Toriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:33.59,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,But this is Toriko's destiny-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:37.38,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:41.09,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We can't eat Nagoya Cochin when we're in the Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:44.02,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It's carnivorous-tori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:48.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:54.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I was worried about my loud voice before I came to PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But ever since I sang my first song,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:59.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I've come to love my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:00.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So the two of us{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:02.08,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:07.09,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu! Galulu ga!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.76,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:14.66,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She said that she hates singing and dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:17.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie, you can understand what Gaalulu's saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:18.46,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:21.31,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Gaalulu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.82,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:26.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,After all, ever since I was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:29.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,my cries have sounded like singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:34.98,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,On top of that, ever since I took my first wobbly steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.98,0:07:36.78,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I've been able to dance well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:40.79,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,So as long as you set your mind to{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.58,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.66,Default-Alt,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:46.82,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:47.82,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.13,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,There's no way that was going to work-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.63,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,There aren't many people who can do what you can-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:55.09,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Eh? There aren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:56.27,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:59.14,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,That's why those who can are called geniuses-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.83,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:05.49,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.62,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Did you lose her-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:12.53,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,All right, let's split up and look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:16.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mega-neesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:20.79,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Has a little girl been through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.70,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,She went that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.91,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It looks like she went up-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:43.97,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.94,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's once again time to do the periodic system inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:04.87,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,We will be changing the weather inside PriPara at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:11.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,All idols currently playing in PriPara, please stay calm and don't panic when the weather changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:13.58,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Is this a drill?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:21.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Check complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:22.72,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:46.78,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,No problems found. That's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:49.25,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Let's check the rest of them tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.80,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.17,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:04.82,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:09.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,So what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:10.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,How will you take responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:11.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:13.34,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.94,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't worry-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:18.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Starting now Aloma will give you encouragement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:22.12,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 9, section 29:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:26.72,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"The little demon's essence shall become a giant monster and the final war of the demons shall{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:31.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What's that sound?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:34.38,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.60,Default,Aoma,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:37.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's a monster-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.17,0:10:39.80,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:44.20,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:45.72,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.18,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu! Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:49.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.18,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Where are you-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:53.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:54.55,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.80,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:58.40,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,That's the monster Gaadzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.27,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,The monster Gaadzilla?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:03.44,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:05.32,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'll see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:08.17,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please make your way outside, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:09.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But Gaalulu is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:12.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll fix this soon so please head to the evacuation area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:19.55,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:32.68,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:32.68,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:39.45,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The TV station...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:41.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Where'd this monster suddenly come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:46.61,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Monster Gaadzilla came out of PriPara's hologramation-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.61,0:11:47.91,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:52.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's possible that someone is\Nintentionally manipulating the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.79,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hey you! Stupid Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:56.93,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Why do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.93,0:11:58.02,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Ga?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:59.12,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,He looked at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:01.63,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:07.44,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Gaalulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:09.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:13.53,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:22.78,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:27.21,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Eh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:30.95,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Don't want to open, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:38.46,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Monster-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.83,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:40.83,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,At long last the final war has descended upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:46.76,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can do it! You can do it! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.22,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:53.72,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Oh, Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:54.62,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:55.43,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:59.60,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,PriPara TV's antenna!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:05.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu is still inside the TV station!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.15,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:11.76,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Everyone, we're setting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:13.17,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:15.37,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,We'll search from the sky-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:21.29,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Gaalulu, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.29,0:13:23.43,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.67,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:28.38,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:30.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:31.94,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:32.72,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:38.03,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:42.99,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:48.10,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I can't move any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:49.78,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Save yourself, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:54.91,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.90,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.29,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:01.08,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:04.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,...about what I said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:12.32,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Don't. Save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:14.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,This is always happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:16.04,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:20.21,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm not all that different than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:21.23,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:25.58,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,But thanks to some magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:28.69,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was also able to stand on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:32.91,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,To me it's a magical item.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.65,0:14:37.68,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,And since I'm like this, I'm always eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:41.80,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'd like you to try it too, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:43.12,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:45.55,Default,Satako,0,0,0,,Sophie-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:48.46,Default,Satako,0,0,0,,incoming Red Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:50.45,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Cha... Chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:52.69,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chankokokokoko....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:15:01.06,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.19,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Ga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:10.62,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Ga-ga-ga-ga-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:14.76,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:23.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie! Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:23.79,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:24.41,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie, you're injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:28.06,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:37.68,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,She coughed something up-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.36,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:42.77,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,What is it-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.25,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,A burr bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:49.06,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Since it's a valuable specimen, we'll keep it in the PriPara Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.36,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.13,0:15:59.30,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,We should be good now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.78,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,We're good now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:09.96,Default,Gaadzilla,0,0,0,,Gaadzilla...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:13.73,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,You caused a lot of trouble for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:16.19,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,PriPara is something everyone desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:17.68,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,It's their dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:20.93,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,And you almost destroyed it, Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:24.46,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.07,0:16:32.11,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu was still really, really worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:36.98,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu can't sing or dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:40.57,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,She's sad and lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.09,0:16:43.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:44.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,...spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.00,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And it wasn't "gaalu gaalu" either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:51.54,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:57.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We want you to watch our concert, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:06.32,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:10.06,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:12.01,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:19.03,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,When you go out on a sunny day, take a light pastel coloured parasol with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:21.62,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sunny Parasol Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:30.60,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Even if it's raining, if you bring a poppin' polka dot umbrella, it'll liven up the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:32.63,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Rainy Parasol Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:33.91,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:36.63,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Even if it's cloudy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.69,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,or there's a splash of monster Gaadzilla in the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:42.08,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,let's perform in impressive Parasol Coords!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.85,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cloudy Parasol Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:19.07,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\i1}Watch us, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:21.82,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\i1}Singing and dancing can be so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:23.90,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}Concerts are awesome-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:27.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to share this fun with you, Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:47.62,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:48.88,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess...{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.87,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess, where are you-kuma?!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:54.03,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:56.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Flower garden in full bloom!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:57.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,For you!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:01.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Lovely Flower Cinderella!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:03.13,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:07.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:55.94,Default-Alt,Fan1,0,0,0,,SoLaMi is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:20:00.15,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu's smiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:02.72,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.85,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Awesome! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.49,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Concerts are awesome! Concerts are fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:11.08,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:15.49,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:20.21,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu caused a lot of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.80,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:24.85,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:27.87,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu loves Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:29.76,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Falulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:31.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Isn't that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:32.81,Default,Miphie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:38.49,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Let's all perform together next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.49,0:20:40.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:44.15,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Lala, it's a little late, but here's your one year anniversary present.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:45.44,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Let me see your charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:46.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:48.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:49.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.05,0:20:51.82,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu will also perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:53.31,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:55.99,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,She'll be the best and end up in the parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:58.53,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Isn't that cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:00.11,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:02.88,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Well, it takes effort to accomplish anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.85,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.85,0:21:07.95,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Wait, it doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:09.70,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's just play biting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:12.05,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu, any type of biting is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:14.93,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,But Gaalulu is the Monster Idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:17.10,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Monster Idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:18.47,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:22.24,Default,Faalulu,0,0,0,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:27.99,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until we meet again, Monster Idol-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:30.31,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:31.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.98,0:23:09.05,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Ah, whenever I think about it I get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:10.26,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:11.46,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.17,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That Mysterious Thief Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.17,0:23:16.39,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I won't forgive him for stealing our coords!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.39,0:23:17.53,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:19.60,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I figured it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:21.43,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Genius's true identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.43,0:23:22.64,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:25.06,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'll catch him no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.06,0:23:26.44,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:27.86,Default,Labu,0,0,0,,Lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.36,0:23:29.28,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.28,0:23:30.10,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:31.89,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Max Pool Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.89,0:23:33.26,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.82,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
